Provenance: DirectAudio is an original driver — Wine has no AAudio backend
upstream. Its structure is modelled on Wine's winecoreaudio.drv, with the
CoreAudio device layer replaced by Android AAudio. Because it derives from and
links Wine's LGPL mmdevapi internals, it is and must remain LGPL-2.1.

